WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.370
This is a red blood cell.

2
00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:03.710
Look closely.

3
00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.170
Something is missing.

4
00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:06.990
It has no nucleus.

5
00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.370
But the nucleus controls the cell.

6
00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:11.830
It holds the cell's instructions.

7
00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:14.850
Animal cells and plant
cells both have one.

8
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:18.190
So why would a cell
have no nucleus at all?

9
00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:21.910
In this mission, you'll look
inside animal and plant cells,

10
00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.910
and meet cells with special
shapes for special jobs.

11
00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:29.570
You'll see how cells build
tissues, organs and whole bodies,

12
00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:33.350
and how materials move
in and out of cells.

13
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:38.020
Your mission: explain why a
red blood cell has no nucleus.
